  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">frozen corn on the cob turns weeknights into a bite of sunshine. Pull the cobs straight from the freezer, steam until tender, then toss with herb-infused olive oil, a dusting of smoked paprika, and a bright squeeze of lemon so the natural sweetness pops. Each juicy cob delivers a playful mix of crisp snap and tender kernels. Serve frozen corn on the cob beside creamy mashed potatoes or slice the kernels into a vibrant summer salad for an easy win. Simple, vivid, and memorable, frozen corn on the cob makes everyday meals feel like a small celebration.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-frozen-corn-on-the-cob\">Why You’ll Love This frozen corn on the cob</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-frozen-corn-on-the-cob\">How to Make frozen corn on the cob</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-frozen-corn-on-the-cob\">Pro Tips for Making frozen corn on the cob</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-frozen-corn-on-the-cob\">How to Serve this frozen corn on the cob</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-frozen-corn-on-the-cob\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This frozen corn on the cob</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Sweet, juicy flavor that brightens any meal.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Convenient and quick to prepare, perfect for busy days.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile ingredient for salads, sides, or grilling.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Nutritious and packed with vitamins for a healthy boost.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-7088\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"7088\" dat